  "sourceTitle": "Healthy Simple Salad",
  "sourceText": "Healthy Simple Salad\nBy: Jennifer\nPublished: Friday, June 3, 2011 - 9:49pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 head of Romaine Lettuce – chopped\n15 ounces Corn\n15 ounces Kidney Beans\n1/4 cup of Cilantro – chopped\n1/4 cup of Scallions – chopped\n1/4 cup of Broccoli – chopped\n1/4 cup of Green Olives – sliced\n3 Limes – squeezed\n1 tablespoon of Cold Pressed Olive Oil\n1 teaspoon of Sea Salt\n1 teaspoon of Cayenne Pepper\n1 tablespoon of Dried Mint\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together and serve. 2 Use Organic Ingredients if Available",
